  "notes": "{縁取|ふちど}り means adding a decorative border or outline to something. From {縁|ふち} (edge) + {取|と}り (doing).\n\nDOMAINS:\n- Sewing/crafts: adding decorative trim along edges of fabric\n- Graphic design: adding an outline around text or shapes\n- Ceramics/tableware: decorative borders on plates, cups, etc.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {金|きん}の{縁取|ふちど}り: gold edging\n- {縁取|ふちど}りをする: to add edging/trim\n- {縁取|ふちど}りされた{文字|もじ}: outlined text\n- {赤|あか}い{縁取|ふちど}り: red trimming\n\nFORMS:\n{縁取|ふちど}りする or {縁取|ふちど}る can both be used, though the する form is more common.",
